'''Kerihime''' (ケリ姫, ''Kerihime'', '''Kick Princess''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Princess Punt Sweets Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 1.4 Update|Version 1.4]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Kerihime
|image = E 027.png
|appearance = [[Princess Punt Sweets Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 1,500¢ - 5,295¢
}}

==Enemy==
Unlike [[Kerihime (form 1) (Enemy)|her other form]], she gains enough range to be capable of outranging [[Asiluga (Uber Rare Cat)|Assassinlan Pasalan]], along with high attack power that can be dangerous for most smaller cats, resulting in her being extremely deadly for early-game players. However, her health is even lower than before, allowing her to be defeated a lot quicker.

==Strategy==
Her attack power is a lot higher than before, but her DPS is still low, so you can use a similar strategy to fighting the first form of Princess Punt.  [[:Category:Rusher-class Cats|Rushers]], such as [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]], [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Maglev Cat]] and/or [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] can land hits on her before her backswing finishes, easily defeating her. However, do not shoot the [[Cat Cannon]] unless there is a strong frontline ahead of her, as this will reset her attack delay and make her attack again.

